# Mini Template

A small, dependency-free TypeScript template renderer for Bun.

## Use as a library

```ts
import { render } from "./src/engine.ts";

render("Hello, {{user.name}}!", { user: { name: "Ada" } });
```

`{{path}}` HTML-escapes text; `{{{path}}}` leaves it unescaped. Supported blocks are `{{#if path}}…{{else}}…{{/if}}` and `{{#each path}}…{{else}}…{{/each}}`. In an `each`, use `{{this}}` and `{{@index}}`; ordinary paths resolve from the root data object.

## CLI

```sh
bun run src/cli.ts TEMPLATE_FILE DATA.json
```

It writes only the rendered result to stdout. Usage, file, JSON, and template errors are written to stderr with a non-zero exit status.

## Tests

```sh
bun test
```

